{"id": "eval-chunk-01", "text": "Nightly database backups run at 02:00 UTC and are retained for thirty days before deletion.", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/backup_policy.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-01", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-01", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-02", "text": "Remote staff connect through the corporate VPN using a hardware token issued by the security desk.", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/vpn_access.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-02", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-02", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-03", "text": "Meal expenses are reimbursed up to forty dollars per day without an itemised receipt.", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/expense_meals.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-03", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-03", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-04", "text": "New joiners collect a laptop from the IT desk on their first working day.", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/onboarding_laptop.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-04", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-04", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-05", "text": "A severity one incident pages the on-call engineer within five minutes of detection.", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/incident_severity.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-05", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-05", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-06", "text": "Service account passwords rotate automatically every ninety days.", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/password_rotation.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-06", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-06", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-07", "text": "员工每年享有十五天带薪年假，未使用的年假可以结转到次年三月底。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/nianjia.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-07", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-07", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-08", "text": "差旅报销需要在行程结束后十个工作日内提交发票和审批单。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/chailv_baoxiao.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-08", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-08", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-09", "text": "考勤记录每月一号生成，迟到超过三次系统会发出提醒。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/kaoqin.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-09", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-09", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-10", "text": "社保缴纳基数在每年七月根据上一年度的平均工资进行调整。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/shebao.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-10", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-10", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-11", "text": "新员工必须在入职三个月内完成信息安全培训课程并通过考核。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/anquan_peixun.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-11", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-11", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-12", "text": "离职申请需要提前三十天以书面形式提交给直属主管。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/lizhi_liucheng.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-12", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-12", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-13", "text": "女员工产假为一百五十八天，其中产前可以休假十五天。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/chanjia.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-13", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-13", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-14", "text": "男员工陪产假为十五天，须在配偶分娩后三个月内休完。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/peichanjia.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-14", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-14", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-15", "text": "病假需要提交二级以上医院出具的诊断证明。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/bingjia.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-15", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-15", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-16", "text": "Restore drills are performed quarterly against a randomly chosen nightly backup.", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/backup_restore_drill.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-16", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-16", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": "", "role": "secondary", "distracts": "q-01"}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-17", "text": "If the VPN client reports a token error, the security desk reissues the hardware token within one business day.", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/vpn_token_reissue.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-17", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-17", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": "", "role": "secondary", "distracts": "q-02"}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-18", "text": "Any expense above two hundred dollars requires written manager approval before it is reimbursed.", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/expense_approval.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-18", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-18", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": "", "role": "secondary", "distracts": "q-03"}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-19", "text": "New joiners receive their directory account and email alias the week before their first working day.", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/onboarding_accounts.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-19", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-19", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": "", "role": "secondary", "distracts": "q-04"}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-20", "text": "Every severity one incident requires a written postmortem filed within five working days of resolution.", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/incident_postmortem.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-20", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-20", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": "", "role": "secondary", "distracts": "q-05"}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-21", "text": "User passwords must be at least twelve characters long and are not rotated on a schedule.", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/password_user_policy.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-21", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-21", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": "", "role": "secondary", "distracts": "q-06"}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-22", "text": "员工离职时未休的年假按照日工资的三倍标准折算发放。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/nianjia_zhesuan.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-22", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-22", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": "", "role": "secondary", "distracts": "q-07/q-13"}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-23", "text": "年假申请需要提前五个工作日在系统中提交，经主管审批后生效。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/nianjia_shenqing.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-23", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-23", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": "", "role": "secondary", "distracts": "q-07/q-13/q-12"}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-24", "text": "差旅住宿标准按城市分为三档，一线城市每晚上限六百元。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/chailv_zhusu.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-24", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-24", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": "", "role": "secondary", "distracts": "q-08"}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-25", "text": "加班需要在考勤系统中单独申报，未申报的加班不计入调休。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/kaoqin_jiaban.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-25", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-25", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": "", "role": "secondary", "distracts": "q-09"}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-26", "text": "社保关系跨省转移需要在原参保地开具缴纳凭证后办理。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/shebao_zhuanyi.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-26", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-26", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": "", "role": "secondary", "distracts": "q-10"}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-27", "text": "年度合规培训在每年十二月进行考核，未通过的员工需要参加补考。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/peixun_niankao.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-27", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-27", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": "", "role": "secondary", "distracts": "q-11"}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-28", "text": "离职交接清单需要经直属主管和人事双方签字确认后才能办理。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/lizhi_jiaojie.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-28", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-28", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": "", "role": "secondary", "distracts": "q-12"}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-29", "text": "产假期间的工资由生育保险基金支付，不足部分由公司补足。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/chanjia_gongzi.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-29", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-29", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": "", "role": "secondary", "distracts": "q-15"}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-30", "text": "病假工资按照本人正常工资的百分之七十计发。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/bingjia_gongzi.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-30", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-30", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": "", "role": "secondary", "distracts": "q-16"}}
